<Layout title="Testimonials - clamcentral.com">
	<main class="px-4 pt-12 pb-20" style="background: #fffcf4">
		<img src="/images/clamcentral-logo.webp" alt="CLAMcentral" width="600" height="121" class="mx-auto h-auto w-[300px]" />
		<div class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[1038px]">
			<h1 style="font-size:clamp(31px, 3.29vw, 46px);line-height:1.30;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px"><strong>Good Stuffs Peoples Say...</strong></h1>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">What's happening here is just a joy to see. It's fun, it's creative, it's new and I want you to check it out.<br /></p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.93vw, 27px);line-height:1.10;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px"><strong>GARY DIXON</strong></p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.10;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">Emeritus Director of NWMinCon, Senior Consultant David C Cook</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">If it wasn't for Tom I wouldn't be where I am today. And I really love the work that he's done, I've seen what he's done over the years. I highly recommend anyone to take advantage of the service that he's prepared to offer.<br /></p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.93vw, 27px);line-height:1.10;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px"><strong>DR. HUGH ROSS, Ph. D.</strong></p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.10;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">Founder and Senior Scholar, Reasons to Believe</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">Tom is one of the most creative people I know. One of my friends once said, "The essence of creativity is the ability to copy." You get to not only copy but you get to use this incredible stuff wherever you're doing ministry.<br /></p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px"><strong>JIM BURNS</strong><br />President, HomeWord</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">Is Tom Finley the most creative mind in the youth ministries world? I do not know but I do believe that he must be in the top three! I have been an eye witness to the implementing of his brilliant ideas through creative activities. His programs are a wonderful combination of solid biblical teaching and pure, good old fashioned fun. I would strongly suggest that you “get on board” and by the way…please do not forget to “buckle up”!</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px"><strong>Alan L. Hubbard MD, FACS</strong><br />Retired Breast Cancer Surgeon</p>
			<h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px, 2.57vw, 36px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(255, 130, 0);text-align:center;margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:12px"><strong>Sunday School Teachers:</strong></h2>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">Even as a longtime believer who's been to church and learned the lessons as a young boy, I was fascinated: I would go in and I'd learn something new in a simple Sunday School. I loved it. I love the curriculum.</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px"><strong>MIKE B</strong><br />Talking about teaching CLAMbake</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">The CLAMbake lesson format is terrific for both the teachers and young students. I've used it with my 8-10 year-olds for nearly ten years.</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px"><strong>BOB FRENCH</strong><br />Resort Restaurant Owner, Sunday School Teacher</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.57vw, 22px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">I started CLAMbake in first grade and attended until I graduated in the fifth grade. This program got me excited to learn about Christ through the interesting Bible stories and games. My mother and I went back to volunteer. Becoming excited about my relationship with the Lord from a young age helped me walk with Him into my middle and high school years. I went on to staff the middle school youth group.<strong></strong><br /><br /></p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.57vw, 22px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px"><strong>HELENA</strong><br />Young Adult</p>
			<h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px, 2.57vw, 36px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(255, 130, 0);text-align:center;margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:12px"><strong>The Kids Party Program:</strong></h2>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">I hope plenty of ministries pick up your amazing kids program! I know God will do amazing things with what you have created!</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px"><strong>KEALA</strong><br />Parent of two KP alumni</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">I had a blast at my first KIDS PARTY and made lots of friends. That was also my first time hearing a talk about God.</p>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:center;margin-bottom:36px"><strong>ADIN</strong> <br />Key youth group staffer</p>
			<h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px, 2.57vw, 36px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(255, 130, 0);text-align:center;margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:12px"><strong>CLAMbake Sunday School:</strong></h2>
			<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.71vw, 24px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(70, 70, 70);text-align:left;margin-bottom:16px">I really am so impressed with what you've put together here. I think it's perfect for our kids. I'm grateful that God has blessed you with a heart for this ministry and to help others build and lead programs in many different time zones.</p>
